        "runExitCode": 1,
        "expected": "No issued session cookie; /api/auth/me 401",
        "observed": {
          "raceStatus": 200,
          "issuedCookie": true,
          "authenticatedMeStatus": 200,
          "liveSessions": [
            {
              "auth_method": "password"
            }
          ]
        },
        "repeat": "Reproduced both initial run and isolated repeat; initial merged config also ran all 143 current public tests successfully but added security acceptance failed."
      },
      "required_fix": "Carry the authenticated password/recovery generation to password session admission and check active user plus same captured salted hash atomically at INSERT; do not reread current hash as the generation after authentication. Add deterministic old-password login paused across reset regression. Keep production PBKDF2 unchanged. No fix applied: review only; auth fix-cycle limit already reached."
